# shir_nodes/map_literal.node — MapLiteral: a whole dict VALUE in
# expression position (`map[K]V{...}` composite literal, JS object
# literal, Zig/Java map constructors).
#
# GENERIC. keys[i] / values[i] are parallel lists (equal length);
# non-string keys stringify exactly like the host object model does.
# A named map built statement-by-statement (assocSet on a variable)
# stays the existing A1 shape — THIS node is only for the anonymous
# expression-position form that previously had no drop-in shape.
#
# Requires build.rs DSL field type `exprs` (Vec<IrExpr>) added for
# list-bearing nodes.

node MapLiteral
tag "MapLiteral"
kind expr
# storage_class str_bounded
field keys: exprs
field values: exprs
